  "description": "Subject\u202f01 was processed with fMRIPrep (v1.0.0\u2011rc1) and the Freesurfer pipeline was enabled. Six functional runs were supplied, each as a NIfTI file: Functional_NIfTI_run\u201101, Functional_NIfTI_run\u201102, Functional_NIfTI_run\u201103, Functional_NIfTI_run\u201104, Functional_NIfTI_run\u201105, and Functional_NIfTI_run\u201106. The anatomical data consisted of a T1\u2011weighted NIfTI (T1w_NIfTI) and a T2\u2011weighted NIfTI (T2_NIfTI), all of type \u201cnifti\u201d.\n\nThe functional runs were assigned task labels as follows: run\u201101 is \u201cfirstrun\u201d, run\u201102 is \u201csecondrun\u201d, run\u201103 is \u201cthirdrun\u201d, run\u201104 is \u201cfourthrun\u201d, run\u201105 is \u201cfifthrun\u201d, and run\u201106 is \u201csixthrun\u201d. Each of these runs has a repetition time (TR) of 2\u202fseconds (Functional_NIfTI_run_01_TR, _02_TR, _03_TR, _04_TR, _05_TR, and _06_TR are all set to 2)."
